{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53740","headline":"歌 · 宜春头陀","name":"歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"经世学，经世学成无用着。\n山中乐，山中乐土堪耕凿。\n瘿飘有酒同君酌，醉卧草庐谁唤觉。\n松阴忽听双鸣（《中国医籍考》卷七十引作「鸠」）鹤，起来日出穿林薄。\n（见《道藏·太平部》收《急救仙方》卷六十《仙授理伤续断仙方序》引）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宜春头陀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53740.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53740","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}